DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44541::$$$message_0383_0000_0000$$$::"Bwah! [wvl canskip=false time=500][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーext face=ぐぬぬ pos=center time=300][hfangry layer=2]Wh-what is happening!? Did I get spit out from the electronic sea into the actual sea!?"::
44542::$$$message_0383_0000_0001$$$::"Maestro, what absurd teleportation have we...[wvl canskip=false time=150][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーext face=楽 pos=center time=200]Hm?"::
44543::$$$message_0383_0000_0002$$$::"This wide-open location... The rough yet meticulously calculated design of these stones... And above all, this water temperature."::
44544::$$$message_0383_0000_0003$$$::"It's clearly hot. Uncomfortably so. And yet, my body yearns to soak in it, and it makes the skin glow..."::
44545::$$$message_0383_0000_0004$$$::"Plaudere! There is no doubt that this is the famous 20th-century Japanese onsen! I've only seen it in the databases!"::
44546::$$$message_0383_0000_0005$$$::"We've done it, Maestro! I am so happy! Oh scions of the flat-faced folk, your ingenuity never fails to impress. If I can bring this technology back to my people, then they will surely...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーext face=楽 pos=center time=300] Hm?"::
44547::$$$message_0383_0000_0006$$$::"Where are you, Maestro...? [wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーext face=泣き pos=center time=600 twno=1][se storage=SE_0008.wav][hfangry layer=2]Come, show yourself. It would be lonely to enjoy this onsen without you."::
44548::$$$message_0383_0000_0007$$$::"YEOWCH, that's hot! [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=キャスターext face=涙 pos=center time=300 twno=2][hfangry layer=2]It's so hot, Master!"::
44549::$$$message_0383_0000_0008$$$::"We've roamed far across SE.RA.PH in search of a private bath. How amusing that it's only three tatami mats wide."::
44550::$$$message_0383_0000_0009$$$::But while I can tolerate its size, the heat is too much!::
44551::$$$message_0383_0000_0010$$$::"Tamamo, since you're basically an animal, please keep the bath mild, around 40°C; that would be gentle on your body!"::
44552::$$$message_0383_0000_0011$$$::"...Huh? Where am I? What is this place? Isn't it bigger than the Izumo onsen?"::
44553::$$$message_0383_0000_0012$$$::"Um, Master? Where have you gone? I was hugging you so tight just a moment ago... [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=キャスターext face=怒 pos=center time=300 twno=1]Are you getting ready to make love in the bath?"::
44554::$$$message_0383_0000_0013$$$::"Mrgh. I've got you dead to rights, you lawless fox."::
44555::$$$message_0383_0000_0014$$$::"Ugh. Is that Red Saber I spy?"::
44556::$$$message_0383_0000_0015$$$::"Yes, it is I. Saber, the main Servant of Fate/EXTRA and universally recognized star of the stage."::
44557::$$$message_0383_0000_0016$$$::"Call me Red Saber... Wait, [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーext face=笑顔 pos=left time=300 twno=1]you just did, didn't you? Mind if I call you Casko?"::
44558::$$$message_0383_0000_0017$$$::"Sure, go ahead.[heart] You know the reasons. It's going to be a little confusing to use our standard class names."::
44559::$$$message_0383_0000_0018$$$::"Then I will. You're a clever woman, even though I wonder if your brain is made of clouds."::
44560::$$$message_0383_0000_0019$$$::"Hehehe. I play the role of a young maiden in front of Master, but in the shadows, I am like a secretary plotting against my rivals."::
44561::$$$message_0383_0000_0020$$$::"That's what it means to be a capable woman. I'm devoted to my husband."::
44562::$$$message_0383_0000_0021$$$::"And yet you keep losing. What happened to your Master? Did they run away again?"::
44563::$$$message_0383_0000_0022$$$::"No, he didn't run away, we just got separated!"::
44564::$$$message_0383_0000_0023$$$::"Aren't you alone too? I don't know who or what your Master is, but where are they?"::
44565::$$$message_0383_0000_0024$$$::"Umu. Well, they were gone when I woke up. Actually I think I was sent here by myself."::
44566::$$$message_0383_0000_0025$$$::"Oh, dear. Oh, my! Only one in six billion people would want to contract with you, so I think you ought to take better care of your Master."::
44567::$$$message_0383_0000_0026$$$::"I could say the same. I know nothing about your Master other than that it's someone who can put up with your black heart. They must be one of a kind."::
44568::$$$message_0383_0000_0027$$$::"You should value that bond. This might be your last chance to."::
44569::$$$message_0383_0000_0028$$$::"We're doing just fine, thank you very much!"::
44570::$$$message_0383_0000_0029$$$::"But it's true I don't have time to waste on you. I need to find my Master[line len=2][wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=キャスターext face=驚き pos=right time=400 twno=1][hfsigh layer=1][se storage=SE_0006.wav]Oh, miss bath-loving emperor? Do you see someone over there?"::
44571::$$$message_0383_0000_0030$$$::"Hm, I do... Beyond the mist, it's clearly a male silhouette. Could it be!?"[skip_next_tag][br]::
44572::$$$message_0383_0000_0031$$$::"Master!? Ahhh! I was so worried! Casko's scared!"::
44573::$$$message_0383_0000_0032$$$::"It's just me, obviously."::
44574::$$$message_0383_0000_0033$$$::"Achao!"::
44575::$$$message_0383_0000_0034$$$::"Bwah! That was close, I almost looked straight at you...! [wvl canskip=false time=160][hffgchg2 chara=キャスターext face=ぐぬぬ pos=right time=300 twno=1][hfangry layer=1][se storage=SE_0008.wav][hfsweat layer=1 ox=-170 oy=60]Oh, what do you mean, 'obviously'!?"::
44576::$$$message_0383_0000_0035$$$::"Well, we always show up together in crossovers. It's happened before. Looks like Sakura won't be joining us this time, though."::
44577::$$$message_0383_0000_0036$$$::"Ms. Blossom? ...Hm. Meaning that someone summoned us here as a set, too."::
44578::$$$message_0383_0000_0037$$$::"That's a swift conclusion. What makes you think that?"::
44579::$$$message_0383_0000_0038$$$::"It's very clear! My Maestro would never voluntarily leave my side!"::
44580::$$$message_0383_0000_0039$$$::"We are always together! The premier couple of the Moon Cell! It must be someone jealous of our relationship!"::
44581::$$$message_0383_0000_0040$$$::"Um, actually, that honor goes to me and my Master. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=キャスターext face=喜 pos=right time=300 twno=1]Anyway, we're mostly in agreement."::
44582::$$$message_0383_0000_0041$$$::"What about you, Archer? Did you also get separated from your Master?"::
44583::$$$message_0383_0000_0042$$$::"Yeah... After selfishly complaining that our room only has a shower, and that they want a bathtub."::
44584::$$$message_0383_0000_0043$$$::"A shower is enough for me, but I can't win against my Master when they're all weepy and unreasonable."::
44585::$$$message_0383_0000_0044$$$::"So I went exploring the Arena to find a bathtub, when I suddenly found myself in this onsen. [wvl canskip=false time=100][hffgchg2 chara=アーチャーext face=笑顔 pos=center time=300 twno=1]The temperature is quite something."::
44586::$$$message_0383_0000_0045$$$::"I'm sure now. The culprit is the one who summoned us. In order to return to our world, we'll have to find this crazed, jealous villain and teach them a lesson."::
44587::$$$message_0383_0000_0046$$$::"Our goals align. Will you join hands to help us return home, Archer, Casko?"::
44588::$$$message_0383_0000_0047$$$::"I don't love the idea, but it looks like I don't have a choice. We don't know left from right in this land, so we should work together."::
44589::$$$message_0383_0000_0048$$$::"Huh? Oh, I know this place. This is Fuyuki, Japan, right?"::
44590::$$$message_0383_0000_0049$$$::"What!?[br]::
44591::$$$message_0383_0000_0050$$$::You're familiar with it, Achao!?"::
44592::$$$message_0383_0000_0051$$$::"The things you know! Is that why your hair's gone gray, from studying too much!?"::
44593::$$$message_0383_0000_0052$$$::"...My hair didn't get bleached by stress... But anyway, come with me. I can give you a tour."::
44594::$$$message_0383_0000_0053$$$::"First, we'll stop by the Mount Miyama shopping district to eat and shop."::
44595::$$$message_0383_0000_0054$$$::"Then we can have a fishing contest at the docks. Finally, we can visit an izakaya pub in Shinto. They've got quite a selection of outlets there."::
44596::$$$message_0383_0000_0055$$$::"Oooh... I've never felt so reassured... Archer, your support has always been this reliable, huh..."::
44597::$$$message_0383_0000_0056$$$::"Umu. You truly are a seasoned warrior. I'll leave this to you, even if you are looking a little smug. [wvl canskip=false time=150][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーext face=喜 pos=left time=300 twno=2]Take it away, Uncle Fuyuki!"::
44598::$$$message_0383_0000_0057$$$::"I'm really more of a big brother than an uncle!"�;(�